# One line-ending for everyone. Three machines see these files: the CM4 (Linux),
# the laptop (Windows, core.autocrlf on), and the desktop bridge VM (Linux). Without
# this, a Windows checkout rewrites every .md to CRLF and the next Linux session sees
# the whole file as changed — 1357 no-op lines on 2026-09-02, which is why this exists.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.docx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.jar  binary
*.png  binary
*.zip  binary
*.pyc  binary
